
This directory is intended for PlatformIO Test Runner and project tests.

Unit Testing is a software testing method by which individual units of
source code, sets of one or more MCU program modules together with associated
control data, usage procedures, and operating procedures, are tested to
determine whether they are fit for use. Unit testing finds problems early
in the development cycle.

More information about PlatformIO Unit Testing:
- https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html

Host tests used in this repo (run from the repo root):

  g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -Werror test/pidf_controller_test.cpp src/Control/PidfController.cpp -o /tmp/t && /tmp/t
  g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -Werror test/directional_limit_test.cpp -o /tmp/t && /tmp/t
  g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -Werror test/position_deceleration_profile_test.cpp -o /tmp/t && /tmp/t
  g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -Werror test/shot_table_lookup_test.cpp -o /tmp/t && /tmp/t
  g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -Werror test/vision_rotate_bench_state_test.cpp src/Control/PidfController.cpp -o /tmp/t && /tmp/t
  node test/vision_rotate_page_test.cjs
  node test/dashboard_control_test.cjs

  # Wired Dashboard firmware path: real WiredControl.cpp + Dribbler.cpp on
  # fake Arduino pins/time/Serial (test/host_stubs/). Build both variants.
  g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -I test/host_stubs -DTEL_HOST_TEST_PIN_TABLE_CONFIRMED=true \
      test/wired_control_test.cpp test/host_stubs/host_stubs.cpp src/IO/WiredControl.cpp src/Dribbler/Dribbler.cpp \
      -o /tmp/t && /tmp/t
  g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -I test/host_stubs \
      test/wired_control_test.cpp test/host_stubs/host_stubs.cpp src/IO/WiredControl.cpp src/Dribbler/Dribbler.cpp \
      -o /tmp/t && /tmp/t
